{"last_link_id": 90, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["🔶 Eses Image Effect Bloom（发光泛光效果）\n这是一个「泛光（Bloom）」效果节点，用于模拟强光区域的光晕感，使图像看起来更有电影质感或梦幻氛围。\n\n参数\t                             含义\nimage\t                  输入图像（需要处理的图像）\nmask\t                  高光区域的蒙版图像（控制哪些区域会泛光）\nlow_threshold\t          最低亮度阈值，低于这个值的区域不会有光晕\nhigh_threshold\t          最高亮度阈值，高于这个值的区域才会触发泛光\nblur_type\t          模糊方式（如 gaussian 高斯模糊）\nblur_radius\t          模糊的半径，数值越大泛光越柔和、范围越广\nhighlights_brightness\t  泛光部分的亮度调整\nblend_mode\t          混合方式，screen 是常见的发光混合模式\nfade\t                  光晕的衰减程度（越高越柔和）\nblur_resolution_limit_px  模糊时使用的最大分辨率，防止模糊操作太慢\n\n用途：让图像的高光部分产生发光感"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [508.4442138671875, 295.4233703613281], "pos": [1490.6822509765625, 1881.90234375], "id": 34, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "modified_image", "links": [41], "label": "modified_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "modified_image"}, {"name": "highlights_image", "label": "highlights_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "highlights_image"}, {"name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "mask", "label": "mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}], "size": [283.3553161621094, 286], "pos": [1156.7032470703125, 1855.37060546875], "widgets_values": [0.8500000000000002, 0.95, "gaussian", 8, 1.0000000000000002, "screen", 0.5000000000000001, 2048], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 43, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "mask", "label": "mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"widget": {"name": "low_threshold"}, "name": "low_threshold", "label": "low_threshold", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "low_threshold"}, {"widget": {"name": "high_threshold"}, "name": "high_threshold", "label": "high_threshold", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "high_thresho